{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116954","id":3344090691,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7HUsZD","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116954","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116954.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116954.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116954","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116954/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116954/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116954/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/46192b7fd8ece3e2d128324d228da434c228d0a4","number":116954,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"GDScript: Disallow implicit use of packed arrays as constant expressions","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"* Closes #67873.\r\n* Closes #88753.\r\n* Closes #100458.\r\n* See also #116947.\r\n* See also the [discussion](https://chat.godotengine.org/channel/core/thread/M6vdDHhiBA56wqB3G) in the Contributors Chat.\r\n\r\nWe can't implement the functionality required for immutable packed arrays in the core (the `make_read_only()` method, as is done for `Array` and `Dictionary`) because it introduces unnecessary overhead. Packed arrays (and the `Vector<T>` template, widely used in the engine) are designed for performance, even at the cost of convenience.\r\n\r\nAlternatively, we could fix the crash for constant packed arrays but not implement immutability. This would mean that the contents of constant packed arrays would be mutable, like `Array` and `Dictionary` in 3.x. However, this option would be inconsistent with the behavior of `Array` and `Dictionary` in 4.x. Furthermore, there could be issues with constant dictionaries (if you use packed arrays as keys). Also, in some places, the compiler might rely on the immutability of constant expressions.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":955079684,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NTUwNzk2ODQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/breaks%20compat","name":"breaks compat","description":"","color":"b64245","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx",